{"seq":3,"slug":"localization-odometry","title":"定位与里程计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/localization-odometry","wordCount":1811,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"定位与里程计\">定位与里程计</h1><p>让一台机器人回答&quot;我在哪&quot;，比让它走路更难，也更基础。运动学告诉我们车轮转一圈机器人理论上移动多少，但轮子打滑、地面起伏、传感器有噪声，纯靠积分的位姿会越走越偏。定位与里程计就是用多源测量持续修正这份估计，并在没有 GPS 的室内、地下、星球表面建立一致的地图。本篇是整个 hub 的状态估计枢纽：凡是后续章节提到&quot;已知位姿&quot;或&quot;地形地图&quot;，背后都站着这里的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>定位问题分三个层次。**里程计（odometry）**只问相对运动：相对起点我走了多远，靠积分得到，必然累积漂移。**定位（localization）**问绝对位姿：在已知地图里我处于哪个位置，可用观测纠正漂移。**SLAM（同时定位与建图）**则在没有先验地图时，一边估计位姿一边建图，两者互为约束。它们的状态估计内核都是贝叶斯滤波或因子图优化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[传感器] --&gt; B[轮/腿里程计&lt;br/&gt;积分 易漂移]&#10;  A --&gt; C[IMU&lt;br/&gt;高频 有偏置]&#10;  A --&gt; D[相机 / LiDAR&lt;br/&gt;外部观测]&#10;  B --&gt; E[多传感融合&lt;br/&gt;EKF / 因子图]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{有先验地图?}&#10;  F --&gt;|有| G[定位: 纠正绝对位姿]&#10;  F --&gt;|无| H[SLAM: 同时建图]&#10;  G --&gt; I[位姿估计 输出给控制与规划]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[传感器] --&gt; B[轮/腿里程计&lt;br/&gt;积分 易漂移]\n  A --&gt; C[IMU&lt;br/&gt;高频 有偏置]\n  A --&gt; D[相机 / LiDAR&lt;br/&gt;外部观测]\n  B --&gt; E[多传感融合&lt;br/&gt;EKF / 因子图]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{有先验地图?}\n  F --&gt;|有| G[定位: 纠正绝对位姿]\n  F --&gt;|无| H[SLAM: 同时建图]\n  G --&gt; I[位姿估计 输出给控制与规划]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>下表对比几类里程计源的特性，解释为何工程上几乎总要融合而非单选。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>里程计源</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>主要误差</th>\n<th>在腿足平台的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轮式里程计</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>打滑、转向时失真</td>\n<td>履带/轮式主力，腿式不适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>腿式里程计</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>足端滑移、接触误判</td>\n<td>提供垂直方向锚点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IMU</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>偏置漂移、积分发散</td>\n<td>高频姿态、补桥接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视觉惯性（VIO）</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>弱纹理、运动模糊</td>\n<td>主力外部观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LiDAR</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>几何退化场景漂移</td>\n<td>大尺度、结构化环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"概率状态估计-从-ekf-到因子图\">概率状态估计：从 EKF 到因子图</h2><p>状态估计的统一语言是概率。系统状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{x}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（位姿、速度、传感器偏置）随控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{u}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">u</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 演化并被观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{z}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0421em;\">z</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 约束。**扩展卡尔曼滤波（EKF）**把运动与观测模型在当前估计处线性化，递推地更新均值与协方差，是车载、足式平台的经典实时选择。其核心两步是预测：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\boldsymbol{x}}_{t} = f(\\hat{\\boldsymbol{x}}_{t-1}, \\boldsymbol{u}_t), \\qquad P_t = F P_{t-1} F^\\top + Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8579em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">u</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1074em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与基于卡尔曼增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>←</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\boldsymbol{x}}_t \\leftarrow \\hat{\\boldsymbol{x}}_t + K(\\boldsymbol{z}_t - h(\\hat{\\boldsymbol{x}}_t))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8579em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8579em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0421em;\">z</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。EKF 只保留当前状态，计算省但对早期错误不可逆。现代 SLAM 多转向<strong>因子图优化</strong>：把历史位姿与路标都设为节点，传感约束设为边（因子），整体最小化误差，并用 iSAM/GTSAM 这类增量求解器维持实时。因子图能做回环修正、保留全局一致性，是 LiDAR-惯性、视觉-惯性大场景 SLAM 的主流框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视觉惯性里程计与多传感融合\">视觉惯性里程计与多传感融合</h2><p>单一传感器都有死角：相机在弱纹理或暗光下失效，IMU 单独积分秒级即发散，LiDAR 在长走廊、隧道这类几何退化场景会沿轴向漂移。**视觉惯性里程计（VIO）**把相机的尺度/结构信息与 IMU 的高频运动信息紧耦合，用 IMU 预积分项约束相邻帧，既补帧间运动又抑制偏置，是无人机与小型移动机器人的事实标准。更进一步，腿足平台普遍采用相机+IMU+LiDAR+腿里程计的多模态融合（如 VILENS 一类全地形腿足里程计框架），在结构稀疏或重复场景中互为冗余。</p>\n<h2 id=\"腿式里程计与垂直漂移难题\">腿式里程计与垂直漂移难题</h2><p>腿足机器人没有连续转动的轮子，里程计要靠<strong>前向运动学+接触检测</strong>重建：当某足判定着地，假定它在世界系中静止，由关节角推算机身相对该接触点的运动。这套&quot;腿里程计&quot;在 GNSS 拒止的地下、室内格外重要，但有两个软肋：足端微滑会污染速度估计；接触误判（以为着地其实还在摆动）会引入跳变。</p>\n<p>一个反复出现的难题是<strong>垂直方向漂移</strong>：纯 LiDAR 在几何稀疏或重复场景中，高程估计会随时间累积漂移。2025 年的工作表明，把腿里程计作为轻量的垂直锚点并入 LIO-SAM 类框架后，长时高程漂移可从 30 米以上压到 30 厘米以内。这说明本体感知（proprioception）与外感知（exteroception）的融合，是腿足定位区别于轮式的关键一招。这份高度可靠的位姿与高程估计，正是 <a href=\"../applications/perception-terrain\">感知与地形适应</a> 构建可通行地图的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定位输出如何驱动整机\">定位输出如何驱动整机</h2><p>定位不是孤立模块，它的输出是控制与规划的共同地基。机身位姿与速度估计直接喂给 <a href=\"../legged/balance-dynamic-stability\">平衡与动态稳定</a> 里的状态反馈——若位姿估计抖动，ZMP/捕获点判断就会失真，平衡随之崩溃；高频的姿态与角速度供给 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 做模型预测；而 SLAM 建出的全局地图与 <a href=\"../applications/perception-terrain\">感知与地形适应</a> 的局部高程图共同决定落足点选择。可以说，定位质量是整机自主性的上限：算法再先进，若不知道自己在哪、脚下是什么，都无从谈起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滤波器与因子图的取舍\">滤波器与因子图的取舍</h2><p>选型取决于三件事：需要保留多少历史、是否需要全局一致、算力是否允许。下表把前述方法放在同一张尺子上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>状态表示</th>\n<th>回环/全局一致</th>\n<th>计算特性</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EKF</td>\n<td>仅当前态+协方差</td>\n<td>弱，早期误差不可逆</td>\n<td>递推，开销恒定</td>\n<td>车载/足式实时姿态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子图 iSAM/GTSAM</td>\n<td>历史位姿+路标全体</td>\n<td>强，支持回环修正</td>\n<td>增量求解，随规模增长</td>\n<td>LiDAR/视觉大场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口优化</td>\n<td>最近窗口内状态</td>\n<td>中，窗口外被边缘化</td>\n<td>固定窗口，实时性好</td>\n<td>VIO 紧耦合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型直觉是：只关心当前位姿、算力紧张、可容忍缓慢漂移，就用 EKF；要在数百米乃至数公里建图里保持全局一致、能回到旧地时回环纠偏，就用因子图；VIO 受帧率与算力两头挤压，常取滑动窗口折中。三者并不互斥——不少腿足系统用 EKF 跑高频里程计、用因子图做低频全局优化，各取所长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>里程计求相对运动必漂移，定位用地图纠偏，SLAM 在无地图时同时估位姿与建图。</li>\n<li>EKF 递推快、只留当前态；因子图优化保全局一致、支持回环，是现代大场景 SLAM 主流。</li>\n<li>单传感器都有死角，VIO 紧耦合相机与 IMU，腿足再叠加 LiDAR 与腿里程计做多模态融合。</li>\n<li>腿式里程计靠正运动学+接触检测重建，软肋是足端滑移与接触误判。</li>\n<li>垂直漂移是腿足 SLAM 的典型难题，腿里程计作垂直锚点可把高程漂移从米级压到厘米级。</li>\n<li>定位输出是平衡控制、MPC 与地形感知的共同地基，质量决定整机自主性的上限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定位与里程计","id":"定位与里程计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概率状态估计：从 EKF 到因子图","id":"概率状态估计-从-ekf-到因子图"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉惯性里程计与多传感融合","id":"视觉惯性里程计与多传感融合"},{"level":2,"text":"腿式里程计与垂直漂移难题","id":"腿式里程计与垂直漂移难题"},{"level":2,"text":"定位输出如何驱动整机","id":"定位输出如何驱动整机"},{"level":2,"text":"滤波器与因子图的取舍","id":"滤波器与因子图的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"轮式与履带式平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/wheeled-tracked"},"next":{"title":"腿足机构与步态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/leg-mechanisms-gait"}}